    {
      "id": "node_info_pow",
      "type": "textInfo",
      "position": { "x": 3200, "y": 650 },
      "data": {
        "text": "Proof-of-Work\n\nThe block hash (a 256-bit integer) must be ≤ the target.\n\ngenesis hash:  0x000000000019d668...\ngenesis target: 0x00000000ffff0000...\n\nhash < target → valid block ✓\n\nBecause SHA-256 behaves like a random oracle, a miner\nmust try ~2^32 nonces before finding one that satisfies\nthe genesis difficulty. Modern difficulty requires ~2^70.",
        "fontSize": 14
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_meets_target",
      "type": "calculation",
      "position": { "x": 3900, "y": 1800 },
      "data": {
        "functionName": "meets_target",
        "paramExtraction": "multi_val",
        "numInputs": 2,
        "inputs": { "vals": {} },
        "dirty": true,
        "version": 1,
        "result": "",
        "error": false,
        "title": "Meets Target? (hash ≤ target)",
        "inputStructure": {
          "ungrouped": [
            { "index": 0, "label": "Block hash (hex):", "rows": 2 },
            { "index": 1, "label": "nBits (4B LE):",    "rows": 1 }
          ]
        },
        "borderColor": "#10b981"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_info_nbits",
      "type": "textInfo",
      "position": { "x": 100, "y": 2700 },
      "data": {
        "text": "nBits Compact Encoding\n\nnBits encodes the difficulty target in 4 bytes (stored LE in the header):\n  byte[3] = exponent  (byte length of the full target)\n  bytes[0-2] = coefficient (top 3 significant bytes)\n\nFull target = coefficient × 2^(8 × (exponent − 3))\n\nGenesis nBits = 0x1d00ffff (stored as ffff001d in LE):\n  exponent    = 0x1d = 29\n  coefficient = 0x00ffff\n  target = 0x00ffff × 2^(8×26)\n         = 0x00000000ffff0000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n\nThe encode_nbits node below converts that full target back to ffff001d.",
        "fontSize": 14
      }
    },
